= Emergence — Simple =

'''Emergence''' is when interactions among many parts create a larger pattern or behavior that the individual parts do not have by themselves.

A traffic jam can form even though no driver is trying to create one.

A flock can move as one pattern even though each bird follows local behavior.

Emergence does not mean magic or something impossible to explain.

It describes a relationship between levels of a system.

